I put on a light jacket.
I step out of my building.
The morning air is quite cool today.
The streets are completely wet.
There is the smell of wet earth everywhere from the fresh rain.
This weather is very nice.
Every step feels heavy.
My whole body is aching.
My head and throat are also aching.
I am walking very slowly on the street.
My legs are feeling heavy.
I feel a little cold from the cool wind.
I adjust my jacket.
The clinic is right near my house.
I see the clinic's board ahead.
Now I should reach there quickly.
And after that, I should go home and rest.
